              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DIGIGIRL"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty good! Easy to make and my boyfriend LOVED them. I thought they were pretty good, but didn't like them as much as he did. Surprisingly, an airier texture and not as sweet as you would expect. I didn't have the hard candies, but otherwise made as specified. Will keep and use again."
