            "reviewBody": "These cookies were sort of a disappointment to me because I was expecting a firmer, sweeter cookie. However, if you're the type of person who likes softer cookies that are semi sweet, than this recipe is perfect for you. These cookies weren't my favorite but my mother loved them.",
